      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 20,
      "padding": 40,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "BEW93",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$text-bright",
          "content": "00 · Read me: the cover-led direction is the main design",
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 32,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "i1he7",
          "name": "Sub",
          "fill": "$text-dimmed",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "On 2026-11-09 the team picked the cover-led direction (\"the cover sets the room\", formerly \"Concept\") as the main design: the song's artwork colour tints the player and the song page, lyrics lead, and the recipe and remix lineage are first-class. Every screen in sections 02–10 now uses it, light mode included; the moderator app keeps its own styling. The previous main screens and components are in 99 Archive, far to the right. Below: the changes from the 11/09 review.",
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "IR4mz",
          "name": "Columns",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 32,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "fOajI",
              "name": "What changed",
